# Motif Engine

See `.cursor/skills/motif-engine/SKILL.md` for algorithms and checklist.

## Constraints

- Pure functions only — no LLM, no side effects
- Output `Motif | null` via `analyzePosition(fen, previousFen?)` — `PieceMap` fields on `BaseMotif` subtypes
- Deterministic templating: `motifToResult`, `buildPuzzleFromMotif`, `resolveTrainingPuzzle` in chess-core
- Future LLM templating may adapt `MotifResult` in `apps/api/` — never in detection hot path
- ≥90% branch coverage; ≥5 positive + ≥3 negative FENs per motif
- Forks: tactical validity via influence map (loose target, royal fork, or value-winning fork) — see skill `reference.md`
- Shared types from `packages/shared/`

## LLM Boundary

This package never imports or calls an LLM. Templating lives in `apps/api/`.
